<string name="video_enhancer_info_dialog_title">AI Image Engine - Video Enhancer</string>
<string name="video_enhancer_info_dialog_message">⚡ MEMC (Motion Estimation &amp; Motion Compensation)\nCreates smoother motion by inserting extra frames between original ones. Perfect for sports, gaming replays, and action movies. Eliminates judder and creates buttery smooth playback.\n\n🎯 Super Resolution\nUses AI algorithms to upscale and sharpen videos. Transforms 720p content to near-1080p quality, bringing out finer details. Ideal for streaming services, older footage, or compressed content.\n\n🌈 AI HDR Enhancement\nOptimizes colors and contrast for more lifelike visuals. Brings out vibrant details in highlights and shadows. Perfect for videos shot in challenging lighting conditions.\n\n⚠️ Important Notes:\n• MEMC and Super Resolution cannot run simultaneously\n• Features require root access for system property modification\n• May slightly increase battery usage when active\n• Works with YouTube, Netflix, Gallery, and most video apps\n• Best results with Vivid or Saturated color schemes\n\nSupported on Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 Pro 5G (Garnet) with HyperOS.</string>

